is in disarmed position.</para></command></action></procbody></condition></cautionproc></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00023734.0004001.042"><para code="00023734.0004001.018" layer="1" lid="N.00023734.0004001.043">Check of the pressure of the door bottle by direct reading on the
