lid="N.00023734.0004001.086">1395</para></entry></row><row lid="N.00023734.0004001.087"><entry><para layer="1" lid="N.00023734.0004001.088">-40</para></entry><entry><para layer="1" lid="N.00023734.0004001.089">1325</para></entry></row><row lid="N.00023734.0004001.090"><entry nameend="col2" namest="col1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00023734.0004001.091">The displayed pressure
